WEBVTT

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:06.400
He defeated it with one attack?

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:45.350
<b>The Reincarnation of
the Strongest Exorcist in Another World</b>

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:50.820
<i>Thanks to my victory over the elder newt,</i>

00:01:50.820 --> 00:01:53.590
<i>that evening's dinner was 
especially scrumptious.</i>

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:58.260
My son achieved something incredible today.

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:03.850
Even a veteran adventurer 
would have struggled.

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:06.480
Seika was very brave, Father.

00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:12.650
Seika.

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:16.440
I'm curious how you knew the 
elder newt was weak to fire.

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:19.080
I'd read about it in a book once.

00:02:19.080 --> 00:02:23.740
And I'd heard that you'd used fire 
magic to drive it away before.

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.330
You made an excellent decision.

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:27.710
I feel obligated to give you a reward.

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:30.830
I have a request, then, Father.

00:02:30.830 --> 00:02:34.620
I've spent a lot of time studying 
magic, as best I can on my own.

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:36.790
As a member of the esteemed Lamprogue clan,

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:39.760
I would like to use my talents 
to benefit the empire.

00:02:40.230 --> 00:02:43.680
Please allow me to enroll 
in Lodonea Magic Academy.

00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:51.350
Very well.

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:52.800
Father!

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:56.640
But just because I'm a count doesn't mean 
my son is excused from taking the exam.

00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:59.380
You must pass the test on your own.

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:00.820
Thank you.

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:03.250
And there's one more thing.

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:09.750
Would you allow Yifa to 
accompany me as my servant?

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:15.920
<i>Yifa can control the elementals.</i>

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:17.460
<i>She'll be a valuable companion.</i>

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:21.510
Yifa has no magical talent. 
So, the answer is no.

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:23.340
You don't need to worry about that.

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:25.090
I'll show you now.

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:35.860
Yifa, if you want to go with me,

00:03:36.260 --> 00:03:41.280
then shout "Flamenought!" and create the 
biggest fireball you can outside the window.

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:52.000
<i>If it means I can go with Seika...</i>

00:03:58.540 --> 00:03:59.960
Flamenought!

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:05.720
Impossible! That's a mid-rank spell!

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:10.890
Satisfied, Father?

00:04:13.490 --> 00:04:14.730
Very well.

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:19.020
What are you thinking, Father?

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:23.280
The Lamprogue clan has never allowed 
two brothers to follow the same path!

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:25.490
And I'm the one who's supposed 
to go to the magic academy!

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:30.160
It's not worth breaking our traditions to 
send a failure and a slave to the academy!

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:34.580
Correct. I will be upholding our traditions.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:35.670
Then...

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:39.590
Which is why you're joining the army, Gly.

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:42.470
Huh?

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:46.560
You have physical strength 
and a talent for swordsmanship.

00:04:46.560 --> 00:04:49.130
I have magical talent, too, unlike Seika!

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:52.730
So, let me ask you, then, what have 
you been doing these past few years?

00:04:53.240 --> 00:04:56.220
Have you worked to improve yourself?

00:04:56.220 --> 00:05:02.530
All I've seen you do is play with your sword 
and run around with a bad crowd in town.

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:05.840
Duel me, Seika!

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:08.120
The winner gets to go to the academy.

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:11.160
And if you lose, you have 
to leave the home, now!

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.910
Are you okay with that, Seika?

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.420
I'm fine with that.

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:19.160
Gly, don't be ridiculous.

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:20.960
A duel between two brothers...

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:24.170
This is between me and Seika, Mother!

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:26.780
I have things that I care about, too!

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:30.050
It's settled, then.

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:32.210
The duel will take place at noon tomorrow.

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:35.100
It will be fought in accordance 
with standard Imperial custom.

00:05:35.100 --> 00:05:39.940
But there will be no using real swords 
or any magic mid-rank or higher.

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.650
I will be the judge.

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:52.360
Well, that's certainly a mess.

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:53.620
Yeah, I guess.

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:56.400
Are you going to kill him, then?

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:58.540
Yuki, I am not.

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:00.330
Coming.

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:02.000
I'll be right there.

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:05.900
Brother Luft?

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.000
I knew you'd still be awake.

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:09.090
Can we talk?

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:11.930
What are you doing here this late?

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:18.340
Seika, I know I'm a bit late, 
but happy birthday.

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:20.690
Here's your present.

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:21.820
You're sure?

00:06:21.820 --> 00:06:23.890
Of course. Open it up.

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:28.950
This is... a glass pen?

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:34.370
You study so much that a quill 
pen wouldn't last, right?

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:37.660
Thank you, Brother Luft.

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:40.830
Sorry, Seika...

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:43.910
For not being kinder to you.

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:47.550
I just... I didn't know how to talk to you.

00:06:47.830 --> 00:06:51.720
But I'm happy to see how you've grown.

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:53.870
I'm proud to be your brother.

00:06:54.750 --> 00:06:58.650
And tomorrow, would you go easy on him?

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:01.710
I'm sure he'll learn his lesson.

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:02.600
Okay.

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:05.650
When you get to school, study hard.

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:09.030
Yeah. You be a good lord, too, Luft.

00:07:10.620 --> 00:07:12.820
I don't have much confidence...

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:19.790
A present?

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:23.290
Hmph. Seems he has, at least, 
a modicum of courtesy in him.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:26.000
Not that I imagine it's worth much.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.800
Don't say that.

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:29.630
This thing's pretty good.

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:35.470
Yuki, hide for a second.

00:07:37.780 --> 00:07:39.480
Wh-Wh-What was that?

00:07:43.820 --> 00:07:45.560
Duel me, Seika!

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:51.050
You couldn't wait until tomorrow?

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:52.360
Shut up! Shut up!

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:55.140
When did your little plan start?

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:59.200
The magic academy? I've always wanted to go.

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:01.140
Well, it's not happening.

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:03.070
You just got lucky!

00:08:03.070 --> 00:08:07.000
You were just lucky enough to have a monster 
show up, and lucky enough to defeat it!

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.860
Forget the conditions Dad gave for the duel.

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:11.760
That stuff's for wimps.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:14.470
The fight goes on until you 
surrender or can't fight anymore.

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:18.260
And if you lose, you tell Dad 
you're forfeiting tomorrow!

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.850
Mid-rank and higher magic is dangerous.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:22.700
So what?

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:26.400
Flamenought!

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:32.360
So what if your slave can use that magic? 
I can use it without an incantation!

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:35.570
Why not make it a little more powerful, then?

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:38.580
He's unharmed?!

00:08:39.690 --> 00:08:40.950
Wind Lance!

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:45.220
A-A barrier?

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:47.500
Light magic?

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:52.930
Wind Lance! Fireball! Wind Lance! Fireball!

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:54.090
Flamenought!

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:56.090
Damn you!

00:08:56.090 --> 00:08:59.760
<i>Gly Lamprogue. You are forbidden to move.</i>

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:08.950
I can't move...

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:14.130
Don't worry.

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:15.130
My arm!

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:15.820
It didn't actually break.

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:17.740
What did you do?

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:20.330
What are you?

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.660
Does that mean you surrender?

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:25.290
I s-surrender...

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:29.040
Tell Dad you forfeit in the morning, then.

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:31.170
Damn it...

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:39.530
You sure it's safe to leave him alive 
after you showed him some of your power?

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:41.390
I promised Luft.

00:09:44.660 --> 00:09:46.320
Well, it's not happening.

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:48.420
You just got lucky!

00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:52.820
You were just lucky enough to have a monster 
show up, and lucky enough to defeat it!

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:56.230
"Lucky"? Hilarious.

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:57.650
Don't be ridiculous.

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:02.200
I've been prepping for this for six months.

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:23.510
It's been so long, Haruyoshi!

00:10:23.820 --> 00:10:29.940
I'm so happy I can serve you once more!

00:10:29.940 --> 00:10:32.060
It's good to see you again, Bonze.

00:10:33.310 --> 00:10:36.860
I was the first one he called, okay?

00:10:37.810 --> 00:10:40.780
Is that the Kudagitsune girl?

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:42.910
I haven't seen you in ages!

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:45.760
Sorry to just summon you out of nowhere.

00:10:45.760 --> 00:10:48.720
What would you like me to do?

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:51.420
I want you to follow my 
shikigami around the mountain.

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:56.250
You should find a monster called an 
elder newt. Drive it from its nest.

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:59.970
"Elder newt"? "Monster"?

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:02.940
Like a giant salamander.

00:11:03.810 --> 00:11:09.390
<i>Before I summoned Bonze, I'd already looked 
at what monsters were on the mountain.</i>

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:14.190
<i>I erected a barrier to stop anyone 
from noticing Bonze, as well.</i>

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:18.990
<i>I hadn't expected the elder newt to 
head straight for the city, though.</i>

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:22.980
<i>Fortunately, nobody was hurt. 
It went mostly according to plan.</i>

00:11:22.980 --> 00:11:26.870
You certainly picked a roundabout 
way to do it, though.

00:11:27.150 --> 00:11:30.550
An easy world filled with weak humans...

00:11:30.550 --> 00:11:34.500
I think you could have 
anything you wanted, right?

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:36.460
Did you forget, Yuki?

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:41.170
In my last life, I was killed 
by those "weak" humans.

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:42.590
Well...

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:48.120
Yuki, in this life, I want to be one of them.

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:51.520
One of the countless masses of weak people.

00:11:53.140 --> 00:11:55.250
<i>This time, I'll be smart.</i>

00:11:55.800 --> 00:11:57.380
<i>I won't fail anymore.</i>

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:02.510
<i>And then spring came...</i>

00:12:03.310 --> 00:12:04.880
Did you forget anything?

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:06.070
I'm fine.

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:09.490
Since Father's not here, he left a message.

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:11.480
"Work hard," he says.

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:12.290
Okay.

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:15.830
Keep Seika safe, Yifa.

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:18.520
O-Of course, Master Luft.

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:21.380
Did you make her stay up 
all night studying, Seika?

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:26.930
Of course. She can't enroll 
unless she passes the test.

00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:29.310
Don't work too hard.

00:12:29.870 --> 00:12:33.600
Well, you'll be spending seven days
in a carriage on the way to Lodonea.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:34.480
So you can...

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:35.940
We'll be studying on the way, of course.

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:39.870
We'll be going now, Brother Luft.

00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:41.230
Take care.

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:43.670
And come back when you're on break.

00:12:43.670 --> 00:12:45.160
I'll consider it.

00:12:51.670 --> 00:12:54.540
Yifa, will you put this on for me?

00:12:55.360 --> 00:12:56.440
Why?

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:58.020
Are you sure?

00:12:58.020 --> 00:12:58.880
Yeah.

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:03.470
Thank you!

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:04.780
I'll treasure it.

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:09.110
Those are all magic stones. 
I think it'll draw the elementals to you.

00:13:09.110 --> 00:13:10.220
Oh, wow!

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:15.190
<i>Yifa's next goal is to be able to use 
elemental magic consistently.</i>

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:19.270
<i>And it's better for me 
if she gets stronger, too.</i>

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:21.320
I can't wait!

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:23.650
What about you, Seika?

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:26.240
Me?

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:29.400
I can't wait.

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:37.540
Are you still not feeling well, Seika?

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:39.170
I'm not...

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:42.960
<i>I forgot how much I can't handle carriages.</i>

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:45.230
<i>It was like this in my past life, too.</i>

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:47.910
<i>Horses are so much faster than oxen!</i>

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:49.590
Wh-What do I do?

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:49.590
<i>Of course I'm going to get sick!</i>

00:13:51.340 --> 00:13:52.830
L-Look!

00:13:53.690 --> 00:13:55.060
We're almost there!

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:03.570
A fortress where those who seek to 
master the art of magic gather...

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:06.820
<b>Episode 2: Academy City Lodonea</b>

00:14:04.230 --> 00:14:06.340
<i>Academy City Lodonea.</i>

00:14:13.550 --> 00:14:16.620
I think he should be there by now...

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:18.850
<i>It's been 12 years...</i>

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:22.290
<i>Has it really been that long
since he came here?</i>

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:33.010
Wait!

00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:39.890
<i>Gilbert's child?</i>

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:44.360
<i>My younger brother Gilbert
was a strange man.</i>

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.780
<i>A free-spirit, and nothing like 
what you'd expect from a noble.</i>

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:49.540
<i>He said he wanted to
see the big wide world,</i>

00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:52.650
<i>and became an adventurer as soon 
as he graduated from school.</i>

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:57.120
<i>But he went missing in demon territory.</i>

00:14:58.350 --> 00:15:02.830
<i>A baby with black hair and black 
eyes. A rarity in this country.</i>

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:06.550
<i>He started using magic at the age of one.</i>

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:12.470
<i>Luft kept his distance from Seika, 
and Gly came to see him as an enemy.</i>

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:17.310
<i>Could he be the child of Gilbert 
and a demon? I wondered.</i>

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:21.980
<i>But Seika had no magical power.</i>

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:24.900
<i>That wasn't a fireball.</i>

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:27.940
<i>It was some kind of ore that was set alight.</i>

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:34.150
<i>And there were strange aspects 
to the matter of the elder newt.</i>

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:39.370
<i>It almost seemed like it 
was slain by poison...</i>

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:43.180
<i>I feel bad for what I did to Gly,</i>

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:46.170
<i>but it was too dangerous 
to send Seika to the army.</i>

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:49.840
<i>Seika could become a hero 
who protects the nation,</i>

00:15:49.840 --> 00:15:54.340
<i>or a demon king that destroys the people, 
depending on his environment.</i>

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:59.350
<i>Gilbert once said the 
academy was a good place.</i>

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:04.300
<i>I hope it still is...</i>

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:15.290
So even you have a weakness, huh?

00:16:15.290 --> 00:16:16.320
I'm surprised.

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:17.740
Well, I am human.

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:21.100
Oh, I got you the room next to mine.

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:24.170
I see...

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:25.290
Is something wrong?

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:30.380
You're my master now, right?

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:32.400
Yeah, I guess.

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:35.300
I got something that looked like a 
certificate saying so from Father.

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:40.180
U-Um... Seika...

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:45.600
Sh-Should I come here tonight?

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:48.400
Huh? Why?

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:51.200
Oh, dinner?

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:54.350
Sorry. I'm not hungry.

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:56.610
Go get something somewhere.

00:16:58.860 --> 00:17:02.080
Okay, I'll go get something 
you'll be able to eat.

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:03.090
Please.

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:09.820
That girl!

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:12.760
She doesn't know her place!

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:19.200
She's just a servant! 
How dare she expect your love?

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:22.270
Is that what she meant?

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:23.700
Oh, yeah.

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:27.960
Yifa's pretty conscious of her status...

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:30.250
I wish she wouldn't worry about it.

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:32.280
That's not it, Seika!

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:35.700
She's head over heels in love with you!

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:37.360
Head over heels!

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:44.500
She's planning on taking advantage of her 
status as a slave to get you to sleep with her!

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:46.250
No way.

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:48.710
It's true! I can tell!

00:17:48.710 --> 00:17:53.150
Oh? You're just an ayakashi. 
What do you know about human hearts?

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:56.880
More than you, I think!

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:58.300
About how girls think, anyway.

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:02.330
Yeah, I don't understand how girls think.

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:04.970
Don't get pouty, Seika.

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:07.850
If you don't study up on it, 
you'll have a hard time.

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:11.120
<i>I'd rather study something else...</i>

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:19.240
It's like a castle!

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.200
What's wrong?

00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:25.010
<i>What is this strange 
stagnating pool of magic?</i>

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:27.180
<i>Well, it is a magic academy.</i>

00:18:27.180 --> 00:18:29.160
<i>I guess I shouldn't be surprised.</i>

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:31.210
No, nothing.

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:35.460
Exam takers, over here!

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:38.510
Please form a line!

00:18:41.900 --> 00:18:43.360
I'm Seika Lamprogue.

00:18:43.360 --> 00:18:47.480
So you're the son of Count Lamprogue?

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:48.450
Seriously?

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:50.730
The famous Lamprogues?

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:53.480
We should try and get on 
his good side right away!

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:55.360
And who's this with you?

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:56.490
I'm Yifa!

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:57.750
What's your last name?

00:18:57.750 --> 00:18:58.950
I don't have one.

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:00.990
So you're a commoner?

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:05.040
No, I'm Seika's... Lord Seika's slave.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:05.950
A slave?

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:07.450
Becoming a student here?

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:09.580
Place your hand here, please.

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:11.020
What's this?

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:12.750
It measures your magic power.

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:17.260
It'll shine white if you have 
aptitude for all four elements.

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:19.090
I've never seen that happen, though.

00:19:19.340 --> 00:19:24.520
<i>This world has its own unique magic 
system based around four elements.</i>

00:19:24.520 --> 00:19:28.890
<i>Fire, water, wind, and earth.</i>

00:19:28.890 --> 00:19:32.370
<i>There's also light and shadow magic.</i>

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:37.530
<i>It feel like it's kind of similar to the 
five elements system that I devised.</i>

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:38.960
You first.

00:19:39.380 --> 00:19:40.150
Okay.

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:51.290
It's weak, but you have 
fire and wind aptitude.

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:54.830
Next, please.

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:55.500
Okay.

00:19:59.340 --> 00:20:01.270
Um, this is...

00:20:01.270 --> 00:20:03.360
Sorry, one more time.

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:06.650
Or do you have aptitude for light or shadow?

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:10.160
This crystal only reacts 
to the four elements...

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:13.380
No, I don't seem to have any magical power.

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:18.190
Can you not take the exam 
without magical power?

00:20:18.190 --> 00:20:21.810
No, it's just a check. You can take the test.

00:20:21.810 --> 00:20:23.280
Okay, then.

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:25.930
He's probably going to use 
his connections to get in.

00:20:25.930 --> 00:20:27.120
Bastard noble.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:29.700
What's he doing here with that slave, anyway?

00:20:32.260 --> 00:20:34.530
Yifa, your fire's showing.

00:20:38.250 --> 00:20:39.340
Quiet!

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:41.920
If you're not going to enroll, 
then get out of my way.

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:50.970
Amyu. Commoner.

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:53.100
Okay, put your hand out, please.

00:20:59.280 --> 00:21:01.000
All four elements?

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:02.400
You're satisfied, right?

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:04.770
Did she say all four elements?

00:21:04.770 --> 00:21:06.540
And so strong...

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:08.660
She's a commoner, right?

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:09.620
Um...

00:21:10.420 --> 00:21:11.290
What?

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:13.790
Uh, thank you.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:14.860
For what?

00:21:14.860 --> 00:21:18.540
Just so we're clear, I didn't do it for you.

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:20.810
They were just getting on my nerves, is all.

00:21:20.810 --> 00:21:23.920
And you make me mad!

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:27.390
There's no place here for someone 
who has no magical power.

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:30.670
I'm sure you'll use your family 
connections to get in...

00:21:30.670 --> 00:21:33.270
but make sure you don't get in my way.

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:36.230
<i>I'm surprised.</i>

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:39.330
<i>Her hair's a different color,</i>

00:21:39.330 --> 00:21:41.860
<i>but she's someone I knew well
 in my previous life.</i>

00:21:44.690 --> 00:21:46.410
<i>Very fascinating.</i>

00:23:30.190 --> 00:23:31.260
Galeos.

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:32.180
Sire.

00:23:34.880 --> 00:23:37.890
Crush the hero.
